6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p022","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m029-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji039-017","subject_person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_A","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p022","quote":"武公稱者，先晉穆侯曾孫也，曲沃桓叔孫也。桓叔者，始封曲沃。武公，莊伯子也。自桓叔初封曲沃以至武公滅晉也，凡六十七歳，而卒代晉爲諸侯。武公代晉二歳，卒。與曲沃通年，卽位凡三十九年而卒。子獻公詭諸立。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"莊伯子","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示親屬或生育敘事；不由繼位補父子，不補闕代。母、女弟、庶孫等依原文；人物暫同指及不同篇主張仍待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji037-067","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","surfaces":["晉曲沃莊伯"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-037-wei"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p012","quote":"宣公七年，魯弒其君隱公。九年，宋督弒其君殤公，及孔父。十年，晉曲沃莊伯弒其君哀侯。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與追稱、衛世系及具體事件暫定所列提及同指；每段原文附存，不按同名字面跨篇合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji039-116","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","surfaces":["曲沃莊伯","莊伯"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-037-wei","c-shiji-039-jin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p012","quote":"宣公七年，魯弒其君隱公。九年，宋督弒其君殤公，及孔父。十年，晉曲沃莊伯弒其君哀侯。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p013","quote":"孝侯八年，曲沃桓叔卒，子胛桓叔，是爲曲沃莊伯。孝侯十五年，曲沃莊伯弒其君晉孝侯于翼。晉人攻曲沃莊伯，莊伯復入曲沃。晉人復立孝侯子郄爲君，是爲鄂侯。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p015","quote":"鄂侯六年卒。曲沃莊伯聞晉鄂侯卒，乃興兵伐晉。周平王使虢公將兵伐曲沃莊伯，莊伯走保曲沃。晉人共立鄂侯子光，是爲哀侯。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p016","quote":"哀侯二年曲沃莊伯卒，子稱代莊伯立，是爲曲沃武公。哀侯六年，魯弒其君隱公。哀侯八年，晉侵陘廷。陘廷與曲沃武公謀，九年，伐晉于汾旁，虜哀侯。晉人乃立哀侯子小子爲君，是爲小子侯。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p022","quote":"武公稱者，先晉穆侯曾孫也，曲沃桓叔孫也。桓叔者，始封曲沃。武公，莊伯子也。自桓叔初封曲沃以至武公滅晉也，凡六十七歳，而卒代晉爲諸侯。武公代晉二歳，卒。與曲沃通年，卽位凡三十九年而卒。子獻公詭諸立。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p029","quote":"十九年，獻公曰：「始吾先君莊伯、武公之誅晉亂，而虢常助晉伐我，又匿晉亡公子，果爲亂。弗誅，後遺子孫憂。」乃使荀息以屈産之乘假道於虞。虞假道，遂伐虢，取其下陽以歸。"}],"rationale":"本篇曲沃桓叔後繼莊伯的同一曲沃君主脈絡，與衛篇晉曲沃莊伯暫接；衛篇稱弒哀侯、本篇稱弒孝侯的不同記事並存，子胛桓叔句待核，不用同指決定抹平差異。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p012","text":"宣公七年，魯弒其君隱公。九年，宋督弒其君殤公，及孔父。十年，晉曲沃莊伯弒其君哀侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m012-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"qy1_adc_gam","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m012-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"隱公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m012-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"宋督","kind":"person","person_id":"tne_qdd_8ct","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m012-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"殤公","kind":"person","person_id":"x0b_9fw_ttm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m012-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"孔父","kind":"person","person_id":"tic_otw_oo2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m012-0030","start":30,"end":35,"surface":"晉曲沃莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m012-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"哀侯","kind":"person","person_id":"jvm_ikp_id9","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p013","text":"孝侯八年，曲沃桓叔卒，子胛桓叔，是爲曲沃莊伯。孝侯十五年，曲沃莊伯弒其君晉孝侯于翼。晉人攻曲沃莊伯，莊伯復入曲沃。晉人復立孝侯子郄爲君，是爲鄂侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":